of the requirements set (in case requirements are missing).
Requirements:
1. When the driver encounters a red signal, the driver shall
stop the train.
2. After the driver stops, the driver can either wait for a green
signal or press the Red Crossing button and perform the
Red Crossing Procedure.
3. If the driver decides to perform the Red Crossing pro-
